      "title_at_revision": "Weight and center of gravity.",
      "text": "[(a) The weight and center of gravity limitations determined under Secs. 27.25 and 27.27, respectively, must be established as operating limitations.\n(b) Each weight that is less than the highest weight allowing hovering in ground effect at any given altitude under Sec. 27.73, and that is used to establish the limiting height-speed envelope under Sec. 27.79, must be established as a weight limitation for operation at that altitude.]",
